# Posting

## Purpose
Posting.

## Requirements

### REQ-LED-1 · Post
status: proposed
The system SHALL post an entry.

#### Scenario: post
- WHEN an entry is posted
- THEN the ledger holds it

### REQ-LED-2 · Reverse
status: proposed
The system SHALL reverse an entry.

#### Scenario: reverse
- WHEN an entry is reversed
- THEN the ledger holds its opposite
