# Posting

## Purpose
Posting.

## Requirements

### REQ-LED-1 · Post
status: proposed
The system SHALL post an entry.

#### Scenario: post
- WHEN an entry is posted
- THEN the ledger holds it

### REQ-LED-3 · Void
status: proposed
The system SHALL void an entry.

#### Scenario: void
- WHEN an entry is voided
- THEN the ledger drops it
