# Journal

## Purpose
Journal.

## Requirements

### REQ-JRN-1 · Record
status: proposed
The system SHALL record a line.

#### Scenario: record
- WHEN posted
- THEN recorded

### REQ-JRN-2 · Replay
status: proposed
The system SHALL replay a line.

#### Scenario: replay
- WHEN asked
- THEN replayed

### REQ-JRN-3 · Rewind
status: proposed
The system SHALL rewind a line.

#### Scenario: rewind
- WHEN rewound
- THEN restored
-- journal-v2.md --
